74
00:09:36,768 --> 00:09:56,087
[Host] That's all for today. Japan passed a law requiring AI-made election content to be labeled and asking social media companies to curb false information, though it carries no penalties and takes effect in March. It's a reminder to check your sources before you vote. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

